IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nba-types`
IMPORT `nba-refugee`
IMPORT `nba-article-31`
IMPORT `nba-notices`

-- Nationality and Borders Act 2022 (UK) — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.
--
--   "Is this asylum seeker a refugee as ss 30-35 require it to be decided;
--    are the s 37 conditions for Article 31(1) immunity met; and what follows
--    from late material under a notice?"

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Asylum case` HAS
    `the asylum facts`                                  IS AN `Asylum facts`
    `the journey`                                       IS A MAYBE `Article 31 facts`
    `a notice`                                          IS A MAYBE `Notice facts`

DECLARE `Asylum position` HAS
    `refugee determination`                             IS A `Refugee determination`
    `s 37 conditions met`                               IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `material provided late`                            IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day the priority removal notice is in force`  IS A MAYBE DATE
    `credibility damaged by lateness`                   IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `minimal weight to late evidence`                   IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN

@ref ss 20-22, 26, 30-35, 37
@export default The position under Part 2 of the Nationality and Borders Act 2022 (UK) for one asylum seeker: the refugee determination under ss 30-35 (and which test failed); if Article 31(1) immunity is in question, whether the s 37 conditions are met; and if a priority removal or evidence notice was served, whether material was provided late, the last day a priority removal notice is in force (s 21), whether lateness must damage credibility (s 22), and whether minimal weight applies (s 26). DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS AN `Asylum case`  @desc The findings on the claim, the journey and claim facts, and any notice
GIVETH AN `Asylum position`
`the asylum position for` c MEANS
    `Asylum position` WITH
        `refugee determination`                         IS `the refugee determination for` (c's `the asylum facts`)
        `s 37 conditions met`                           IS
            CONSIDER c's `the journey`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST f  THEN JUST (`the s 37 conditions for Article 31(1) immunity are met by` f)
        `material provided late`                        IS
            CONSIDER c's `a notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`the material was provided late under` n)
        `last day the priority removal notice is in force` IS
            CONSIDER c's `a notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN `the last day the priority removal notice is in force for` n
        `credibility damaged by lateness`               IS
            CONSIDER c's `a notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`lateness must be taken as damaging credibility under` n)
        `minimal weight to late evidence`               IS
            CONSIDER c's `a notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`minimal weight applies to the evidence under` n)
